OL,3,GNEWSARescuer admits defeat in battle to
OL,4,Akeep Harriet the badger
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ecologist from the Borders has
OL,7,Fadmitted defeat in his battle to be
OL,8,Fallowed to keep a badger he nursed back
OL,9,Fto health after she was found in a
OL,10,Fcattle trough.
OL,12,FGraeme Wilson, who runs a small
OL,13,Fwildlife rehabilitation service at his
OL,14,Fhome in Denholm, had an application to
OL,15,Fkeep the animal - named Harriet -
OL,16,Frejected by NatureScot.
OL,18,FHis bid to keep the badger was then
OL,19,Fstrongly criticised by three animal
OL,20,Fwelfare charities.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
