OL,3,GNEWSARescuer admits defeat in battle to
OL,4,Akeep Harriet the badger
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilson said Harriet had been moved to a
OL,7,Fnew home which was licensed to keep her
OL,8,Fand he was going to take a break from
OL,9,Fwildlife rescue.
